12
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
Valdez Is Coming is a 1971 American Western film directed by Edwin Sherin and
starring Burt Lancaster, Susan Clark, Richard Jordan and Jon Cypher.

13
01:18:52,000 --> 01:18:58,000
The film is based on the 1970 Elmore Leonard novel of the same name.

14
01:24:56,000 --> 01:25:02,000
The film explores themes of one man army, posse, mexican
american, small town sheriff, weapons trafficking.
